import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | AI Search Lab" description="How optional portfolio analytics works and how to change your choice.">
  <main>
    <h1>Privacy and analytics</h1>
    <p>This portfolio uses Google Analytics only after you select “Allow analytics.” You can decline and continue using the site.</p>
    <p>Analytics records page visits and clicks on the public résumé, email link, and LinkedIn link. A click does not establish that a document was read or a message was sent.</p>
    <p>Google Analytics uses cookies and processes technical information about your browser and device. The custom events do not include form contents or email addresses. Page URLs sent by this implementation omit query strings and fragments. Advertising personalization and Google signals are disabled in the site configuration.</p>
    <p>Your analytics choice is saved in this browser’s local storage. Use “Analytics preferences” below to change it. Declining stops future collection by this integration; it does not erase previously collected data or existing cookies. You can clear this site’s stored data through your browser settings.</p>
    <p>Analytics is disabled on local and preview hostnames and on the rendering-test fixtures. Browser settings, blockers, and visitor choices can prevent collection, so reports do not represent every visit.</p>
    <p>See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s privacy policy</a> for information about Google’s processing. Contact details are on the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
